of yours? Agumon!

00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:08.940
I wonder what's taking them so long. Come back, Gatomon.

00:18:08.940 --> 00:18:12.280
I couldn't stand it if anything happened to you.

00:18:12.280 --> 00:18:15.360
But I'm sure Ty and Agumon will take good care of you.

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:18.460
Nice try, buddy!

00:18:18.460 --> 00:18:21.460
If the Digidestined are coming to defend Gatomon,

00:18:21.460 --> 00:18:24.480
then they really must think she is the 8th Digimon!

00:18:24.480 --> 00:18:27.560
Hey, what they think is no business of yours,

00:18:27.560 --> 00:18:30.000
go blow smoke somewhere else! You will pay

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:31.140
Pay for your impudence!

00:18:31.140 --> 00:18:32.420
Just what do you mean?

00:18:36.240 --> 00:18:38.240
I hope you like fishing, Gatoman!

00:18:38.240 --> 00:18:42.360
Because you're going to be the perfect bait to lure out the 8th Digi-Destined Child!

00:18:42.360 --> 00:18:45.620
Now I don't need the Crest to find that cowardly, puny human!

00:18:45.620 --> 00:18:47.380
That's not fair, Myotismon!

00:18:47.380 --> 00:18:49.000
I don't play fair!

00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:51.440
STOP! Gatoman!

00:18:57.670 --> 00:19:00.000
Will Tai rescue Gatoman before

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:05.180
Before Myotismon finds Kari, tune in to the next Digimon Digital Monsters.
